me><surname>Watson</surname><given-names>HS</given-names></name><name><surname>Klugo</surname><given-names>RC</given-names></name><name><surname>Coffield</surname><given-names>KS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pneumoscrotum: report of two cases and rewiew of the mechanisms or its development</article-title><source>Urology</source><year>1992</year><volume>40</volume><fpage>517</fpage><lpage>521</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1466104</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0090-4295(92)90406-M</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mateos Colino</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Golpe Gomez</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Gonzalez Rodriguez</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Sousa Escandon</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Gonzalez Uribarri</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Seirulo Salas</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Neumoescroto secundario a efisema sudcutaneo masivo tras el drenale de un neumotorax espontaneo</article-title><source>Actas Urol Esp</source><year>2004</year><fpage>606</fpage><lpage>609</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15529928</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>